<title>UK: Verity in Samsung loudspeaker deal.</title>
<headline>Verity in Samsung loudspeaker deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British loudspeaker and electronic audio products manufacturer Verity Group Plc said on Thursday its unit New Transducers Ltd had signed a licensing agreement with Korea's Samsung Electro-Mechanics.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, Samsung Electro Mechanics, part of Samsung Electronics Co will manufacture loudspeakers using NXT's flat-panel technology for the personal computer, multi-media, audio and video industries.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
